# Placeholder directory for bundled YOLO11s weights (.pt).
#
# Pre-trained weights (best.pt) are downloaded automatically from
# Hugging Face (Yashwanth1508/AgroAI-pest-detection) on first load. To
# bundle weights locally instead, copy best.pt into this directory.
#
# Weights are NOT committed to this repository (large binary). See README.md.
